==English==

===Etymology===
From {{suffix|en|clandestine|ly}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/klænˈdɛs.tɪn.li/|a=US}}
* {{hyphenation|en|clan|des|tine|ly}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv}}

# In a [[secret]] or [[covert]] manner.
#* {{RQ:Landon Lady Anne Granard|page=211|volume=I|passage=In another moment, Louisa's arms were around her also, welcoming her to Violet Lodge, and pouring on her a thousand thanks, yet asking, with trepidation, "have you brought the dear girls '''clandestinely'''?"}}
# In an [[illicit]] way, i.e. not permitted by the [[law]] or [[regulations]].

